    /// Begins a key-value pair. Dc 312 separates the nonempty key and value regions; Dc 515 closes the pair. Nested framed data and escaped characters belong to their operand rather than delimiting the enclosing pair. Operand regions retain their historical syntax; this rule does not impose a narrower expression grammar. (`514`).
